@startuml
skinparam defaultFontName "Noto Sans CJK JP"

actor User
participant "PredictionHistory\n(Parent)" as Parent
participant "HistoryTable\n(Child)" as Table
participant "api.ts\n(Service)" as API

box "Backend (Django)" #f8f9fa
    participant "PredictionHistoryView" as View1
    participant "ExportCSVView" as View2
    database "SQLite" as DB
end box

== 1. 履歴取得フェーズ (初期表示 & 件数変更) ==

User -> Parent: ページ表示 / 表示件数変更
activate Parent

Parent -> API: getHistory(limit)
API -> View1: GET /api/history/?limit=X
activate View1

View1 -> DB: Group By (batch_id)\n& Aggregation (Min/Avg)
DB --> View1: summary_query

loop batch_id ごとのループ
    View1 -> DB: 紐づく全桁を取得
    View1 -> View1: 文字列結合 (full_digit)
end

View1 --> API: JSON (結合済みデータ)
deactivate View1

API --> Parent: history data
Parent -> Table: Props伝播 (history)
Table --> User: 履歴一覧表示
deactivate Parent

== 2. CSVエクスポートフェーズ ==

User -> Parent: 「CSVダウンロード」クリック
activate Parent

Parent -> API: getExportUrl()
Note over Parent, API: window.location.href により\nブラウザが直接URLを叩く

Parent -> View2: GET /api/history/export/
activate View2

View2 -> DB: 全履歴をSELECT (ORDER BY)
View2 -> View2: CSVヘッダー & 行生成
View2 --> User: HTTP Response (text/csv)\n※ファイル保存ダイアログ
deactivate View2

deactivate Parent

@enduml